     "components": [
      {
       "component_id": "customize",
       "data": "{\"data\":\"<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><h1 style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\">Notices</span></strong></h1></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h3><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\">Permanent Combat Event &#34;Stygian Onslaught&#34;: Defeat Powerful Foes and Uncover Hidden Treasures!</span></strong></h3><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><custom-image url=\\\"https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/21/41133912/8405aeb81ab4830ade9bc9d9df93149d_6943665321489032823.png\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"></custom-image><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 215, 128)\\\">June 18, 2025</span></strong><br><br>Greetings Traveler! Version 5.7 introduces the new permanent combat event &#34;Stygian Onslaught.&#34; </p><custom-post posts=\\\"39387781\\\"></custom-post></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h3><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\">Stygian Onslaught Event: Disturbance-affected Ley Line challenges</span></strong></h3><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><custom-image url=\\\"https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/21/41133912/8cc966dfcee163e2a087f9cdd870fa8b_1496609040620149003.png\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"></custom-image><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 215, 128)\\\">June 23, 2025</span></strong><br><br></p><custom-post posts=\\\"39580848\\\"></custom-post></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h3><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\">Permanent Combat Event &#34;Stygian Onslaught&#34; Is Now Available! Here Are Some Tips for You~</span></strong></h3><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\"><p><custom-image url=\\\"https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/21/41133912/eb89fe3715de5eb7691a1d71a47fff4f_7024763339642523300.png\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"></custom-image><strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(255, 215, 128)\\\">June 25, 2025</span></strong><br><br>Greetings, Traveler! The new permanent combat event &#34;Stygian Onslaught&#34; is now available. In the event details released previously, we&#39;ve introduced the basic rules, obtainable rewards, and event schedule.<br><br>We&#39;ve compiled a few tips here based on your experience and feedback during the test period. Let&#39;s check it out together~</p><custom-post posts=\\\"39626327\\\"></custom-post></td></tr></tbody></table>\"}\n"
